        "language": "rongmei",
        "title": "He neila Khristmas munpuang",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. He neila Khristmas munpuang gaimei tuai the,",
            "Tingkum man nimei thei lai kan the;",
            "Kaban tei sinna nu maknga tat kan the,",
            "He neila Khristmas.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Nkhuanno (2), njianmei nkhuan no,",
            "Arup arian njianmei nun;",
            "Ntam the he neila Khristmas.",
            "",
            "2. He Raguang ntam kan nimei njianmei,",
            "Neikhat na sini bam laknga cho?",
            "Aniu khang gaimei munpuang teituai kanthe,",
            "He neila Khristmas.",
            "",
            "3. Kei dat nimei tei hou khang tei chamdan o,",
            "Nkhuan bammo tingkauh thanmei ta;",
            "Suaihiam kathanmei tuang guaini la puni,",
            "He neila Khristmas.",
            "",
            "4. Tingkauh kandih ganloumei tuangtei kumma,",
            "Ntam mak numak ge poubaumei;",
            "Nangjan tei sanna hei khou tei huai bamni,",
            "He neila Khristmas."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
